        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_02",
      "hash64": "E4F2D7E37D111AE3",
      "text": "Así que Mencía te va a acompañar hasta la\\nacademia, ¿eh?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_01",
      "hash64": "C21E4249095E5426",
      "text": "¡Eso es! ¡Déjelo en mis manos![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_03",
      "hash64": "E4F2D6E37D111930",
      "text": "Ay, cómo me alegro de que ya hayas hecho una\\namiga.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_04",
      "hash64": "E4F2DDE37D112515",
      "text": "Por cierto, he estado mirando el folleto de\\nla academia y ¡los profesores parecen todos\\r\\nestupendos!\\c\\nY, además, hay instalaciones utilísimas que los\\nalumnos pueden usar cuando quieran.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 189,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_05",
      "hash64": "E4F2DCE37D112362",
      "text": "Seguro que, entre todo eso y la compañía de\\nMencía, tu vida en la academia va a ser de lo\\r\\nmás entretenida.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_09",
      "hash64": "E4F2E0E37D112A2E",
      "text": "Espero que estés a gusto en la residencia,\\n¡y que no se te olvide comer bien![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_06",
      "hash64": "E4F2DBE37D1121AF",
      "text": "Mira, aquí tienes el almuerzo y algo de dinerito.\\n¡Úsalo con cabeza![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_10",
      "hash64": "E4EF53E37D0E04C0",
      "text": "Llévate también esto, anda.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_11",
      "hash64": "E4EF54E37D0E0673",
      "text": "Te servirán para curar a tu querido compañero\\nPokémon si resulta herido.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_12",
      "hash64": "E4EF55E37D0E0826",
      "text": "Ahora que te vas de casa, te esperan un montón\\nde experiencias nuevas día sí y día también.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_13",
      "hash64": "E4EF56E37D0E09D9",
      "text": "Tendrás momentos de diversión y momentos\\ndifíciles, pero hay que vivirlos todos al máximo.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_07",
      "hash64": "E4F2DAE37D111FFC",
      "text": "Y recuerda que puedes venir a casa a descansar\\ncuando quieras, ¿vale?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_0095_mama_08",
      "hash64": "E4F2E1E37D112BE1",
      "text": "Uy, que os tengo aquí entretenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oas y a este paso\\nse os va a hacer tarde. ¡Id con cuidado![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_02",
      "hash64": "C21E4149095E5273",
      "text": "Ay, ¡qué maja es tu madre![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_03",
      "hash64": "C21E4049095E50C0",
      "text": "Esto... Iba a enseñarte a atrapar Pokémon, ¿no?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "common_0095_rival_04",
      "hash64": "C21E4749095E5CA5",
      "text": "¡Venga, vamos![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
